[COLOR="DeepSkyBlue"]2.28 (58)[/COLOR]:
[LIST]
[*] Added a [COLOR="MediumSeaGreen"]/mem <id number>[/COLOR] to allow you to use mementos that you have already unlocked by their id number. (Feature requested by kn1ne.)
You can use the existing [COLOR="MediumSeaGreen"]/getmemento[/COLOR] command to get a full list of mementos and their id numbers printed in chat but it will include mementos that you have not yet unlocked and therefore cannot use.
Note that memento effects will last however long they are programmed (by ZOS) to last. For instance Booknado seems to last forever but does eventually end. Memento effects cannot be cancelled, you just have to wait them out.
[/LIST]

